                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> which don&apos;t have applicable value </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>is taken out of the sample</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555'>Note</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555'>: There is an unexplained sessions peak starting in 21.11.2022 for Jordan, Oman, Bahrain, UAE and Iraq. Which reflects as a great dip in the CVR. We have contacted with the Product team and waiting an update from their side.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
